# amd64 "MOST CAPABLE" desktop set — a full KDE Plasma workstation.
# Concatenated onto packages-desktop.list + packages-desktop-full.list by the
# builder ONLY for --capable (the standalone-thick role presets it). Curated from
# this build host's own /var/lib/portage/world (a desktop/plasma profile box) but
# trimmed to a coherent FOSS workstation — proprietary -bin browsers / Discord /
# Zoom / Steam-native and host-specific dev cruft are intentionally NOT here (Steam
# is wired separately via packages-media-data.list + the media-data feature).
#
# Regenerate / extend from a running box with:
#   scripts/seed-packages-from-running-system.sh --output mylist.list
#   ./build-x86-host-stage4.sh --role standalone-thick --seed-packages-from mylist.list

# ── KDE Plasma desktop + workspace ──
# NOTE: the display manager stays lightdm (configured for the standalone desktop);
# Plasma is selected as the lightdm user-session (plasmax11), so SDDM is NOT pulled.
kde-plasma/plasma-meta
kde-apps/dolphin
kde-apps/konsole
kde-apps/kate
kde-apps/ark
kde-apps/gwenview
kde-apps/okular
kde-plasma/spectacle
kde-apps/kcalc
kde-apps/kfind
kde-apps/kwrite
kde-apps/filelight
kde-apps/kgpg
kde-misc/kdeconnect
kde-apps/khelpcenter

# ── Browsers / office / mail (FOSS) ──
www-client/firefox
app-office/libreoffice
mail-client/thunderbird

# ── Media / graphics / audio / video ──
media-gfx/gimp
media-gfx/inkscape
media-gfx/krita
media-video/mpv
media-video/vlc
media-video/ffmpeg
media-video/obs-studio
media-sound/audacious
media-sound/audacity
media-sound/pavucontrol-qt
media-video/pipewire
media-video/wireplumber

# ── Comms (Matrix native client) ──
net-im/neochat

# ── Developer toolchain (a capable workstation) ──
dev-vcs/git
dev-vcs/git-lfs
app-editors/neovim
app-editors/vim
dev-lang/python
dev-lang/go
dev-lang/rust-bin

# ── Utilities ──
app-arch/p7zip
app-arch/unzip
sys-process/htop
sys-apps/flatpak
